Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,《夺宝奇兵2：魔域奇兵》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:03:01.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1935年 上海）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 原来你会说我的语言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never told me you spoke my language, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只在特别的场合才说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only on special occasions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你真的找到努尔哈赤了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it is true? You found Nurhachi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,明知故问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚你的手下还想把它抢走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night one of your boys tried to get Nurhachi without paying for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你侮辱我儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have insulted my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你侮辱了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you have insulted me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饶了他一命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spared his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不打算作介绍？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you going to introduce us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.90,0:03:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是威莉·丝葛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Willie Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳·琼斯 著名考古学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Indiana Jones, famous archeologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为考古学家都是四处找木奶妈的矮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I thought archeologists were always funny little men searching for their mommies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是木乃伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士替我找来努尔哈赤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones found Nurhachi for me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且会马上把它交出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's going to deliver him now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是努尔哈赤？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, who is this Nurhachi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪收起来 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun away, sonny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快还清你欠我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you give me what you owe me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则一切告吹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anything goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The diamond, Lao.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家有言在先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deal was for the diamond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿劳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lao…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你身体健康{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your very good health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿劳 他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lao! He put a hole…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.69,0:05:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我的法国裙子给捅了两个洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put two holes in my dress from Paris!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在快给我努尔哈赤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you bring me Nurhachi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟谁是努尔哈赤？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who on Earth is this Nurhachi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个努尔哈赤果真是个矮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Nurhachi's a real small guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是努尔哈赤的骨灰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside are the remains of Nurhachi, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,满清的第一个皇帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}first Emperor of Manchu Dynasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, old boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在快还我钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, you give me the diamond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是故作幽默{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to develop a sense of humor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我听错了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or am I going deaf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antidote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.47,0:06:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,解什么的药？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,解你刚喝的毒酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poison you just drank, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种毒效力迅速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poison works fast, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿劳！- 阿劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lao. - Lao!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大可以另找女歌星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep the girl. I find another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿服务周到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good service here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是侍应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a waiter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡汉是老朋友 胜负未分…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wu Han's an old friend. Game's not over, Lao.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antidote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我会救你走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Wu Han, I'll get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time, Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾多次探险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed you on many adventures, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但神秘的灵界 我要先行一步了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but into the great unknown mystery, I go first, Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be sad, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就能跟他共赴黄泉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will soon be joining him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝醉了 琼斯博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much to drink, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nuts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 解药！- 钻石呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The antidote. - Where's the diamond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.61,0:09:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! Holy smoke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:10:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急着陆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crash landing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉 快开车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short Round, step on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你坐稳吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okeydokey, Dr. Jones. Hold on to your potatoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,司机是个小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For crying out loud, there's a kid driving the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the antidote? Let me have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是初次相识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I just met you, for Christ's sakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.05,0:11:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我解药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是随便的女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not that kind of girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 没空缠绵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dr. Jones, no time for love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,后有追兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你呛死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hope you choke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shooting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自找麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you asked for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真刺激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿稳这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的枪呢？枪在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my gun? Where's my gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.37,0:12:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很烫手 指甲断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I burned my fingers, and I cracked a nail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 我叫韦柏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones… I'm Art Weber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.01,0:12:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,早跟你助手谈过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke with your assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,已预留了三个位子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've managed to secure three seats, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.81,0:13:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你们要跟家禽同舱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there might be a slight inconvenience as you will be riding on a cargo full of live poultry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说笑吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间太仓促{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, it's the best I could do on such short notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是美国著名女歌星威莉吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavens, aren't you Willie Scott, the famous American female vocalist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你一个人情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owe you a gin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓不到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, Lao Che.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.63,0:14:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是驯兽师吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you supposed to be, a lion tamer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.59,0:14:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你跟着来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm allowing you to tag along, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.47,0:14:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就少开腔吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why don't you give your mouth a rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗 美女？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, doll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟着来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "tag along"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次在俱乐部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since you got into my club, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你一直盯着我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you haven't been able to take your eyes off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:49.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中国 上海）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:57.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重庆）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 先生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Mister, mister…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 快醒来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, mister, wake up. Please, mister…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要叫他琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call him Dr. Jones, doll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 快起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Dr. Jones, Dr. Jones. Oh, wake up, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达了吗？好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we there already? Oh, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.43,0:16:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人驾驶飞机！- 哦 天呐…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one's flying the plane! - Oh, boy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,机师都走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've all gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会驾驶飞机吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to fly, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天呐 - 这会有多难？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - How hard can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.49,0:16:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要休克了 - 测高仪 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna faint. - Altimeter! Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,空速 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air speed. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.12,0:16:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.68,0:17:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有大麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got a big problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琼斯博士！- 豆钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr. Jones! - Shorty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 没有降落伞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones! No more parachutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.73,0:17:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快来帮忙 - 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, give me a hand! - What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,推开箱子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move the box!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 你疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, you're crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉 拿我们的东西来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty, get our stuff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,橡皮艇？这不是沉船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boat? We're not sinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是撞机！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're crashing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳 豆钉 抓稳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab on, Shorty! Grab on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小姐 我透不过气了 - 太紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady, I can't breathe! - Tight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快减速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不是太糟吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't so bad, was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on the brakes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.57,0:18:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌水 我讨厌弄湿身子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the water, and I hate being wet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还讨厌你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I hate you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 豆钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right, Shorty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们究竟到了哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,印度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望这代表吃晚饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure hope this means dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.91,0:21:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I'm starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.41,0:21:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.13,0:21:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能吃这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't eat this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.97,0:21:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些粮食比这些人所需的一周还要多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more food than these people eat in a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.26,0:21:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,时值饥荒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.97,0:21:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你可以吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. You can have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:21:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快吃掉它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.64,0:22:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不饿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.98,0:22:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在侮辱他们 也让我出丑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insulting them, and you're embarrassing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快吃 - 吃掉它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eat it. - Eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.46,0:22:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,该有坏消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.38,0:22:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可否派导游带我们去德里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you provide us with a guide to take us to Delhi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个教授 我要回大学去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a professor. I have to get back to my university.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙努可作向导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Sajnu will guide you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在去德里途中 你会路经彭高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the way to Delhi, you will stop at Pankot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才不顺路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pankot is not on the way to Delhi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会去彭高皇宫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will go to Pankot Palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.03,0:22:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为那儿已经荒废了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the palace had been deserted since the 1850s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:22:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那儿有一个新王公{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Now there is a new Maharajah, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.45,0:23:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而皇宫再次拥有邪恶的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and again the palace has the power of the Dark Light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它杀害我的人民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is that place kill my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.63,0:23:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪魔以彭高为基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evil start in Pankot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后这股歪风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then like monsoon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为祸无穷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it moves darkness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,令整个国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over all country, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷入水深火热之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over all country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.73,0:23:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪魔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.36,0:23:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么邪魔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What evil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.69,0:23:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗？坏消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.99,0:23:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我苏华武的话 就会更长命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to Suwamu. You leave Lanka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.24,0:23:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇宫的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came from palace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.79,0:23:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走了我们村的湿婆石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and took Sivalinga from our village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.25,0:23:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么石？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是保护这个村子的圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a stone, a sacred stone from a shrine that protects the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:23:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是湿婆派你来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is why Siva brought you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.98,0:24:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人派我们来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't brought here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们撞机后着陆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our plane crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.90,0:24:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机撞毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.73,0:24:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.74,0:24:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们祈求湿婆帮我们找回圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We prayed to Siva to help us find the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是湿婆令你从天而降{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Siva who made you fall from the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.46,0:24:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去彭高皇宫把湿婆石给我们拿回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you will go to Pankot Palace to find Sivalinga and bring back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,解我们之困{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.51,0:24:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 是他们令飞机坠毁 要你来这？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, did they make the plane crash to get you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.69,0:24:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那只是个鬼故事 放心吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Shorty, it's just a ghost story. Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.78,0:25:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在这里把圣石偷走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took the stone from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.78,0:25:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣石表面光滑 如圣河之石？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the stone very smooth like a rock from a sacred river?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.95,0:25:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,石上有三条纹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With three lines across it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表宇宙三个层面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}representing the three levels of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.63,0:25:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.29,0:25:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过那种石头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen stones like the one you lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.55,0:25:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何王公要拿走这圣石？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why would Maharajah take the sacred stone from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.34,0:25:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我们祭拜其邪神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They says we must pray to their evil god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.06,0:25:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不肯就范{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We says we will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.73,0:25:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块石头怎么能毁掉整条村？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, I don't understand how one rock could destroy a whole village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.49,0:25:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣石被偷走后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's saying when the sacred stone was taken, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,井干河涸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the village wells dried up, and the river turned to sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.04,0:25:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,农田尽毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crops were swallowed by the earth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,禽畜皆亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the animals laid down and turned to dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.25,0:25:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一晚田里着火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one night there was a fire in the fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,村民赶去救火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men went out to fight the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来时满脸愁容{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they came back, the women were crying in the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.44,0:26:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.98,0:26:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说小孩子都被坏人掳走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says they stole their children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.03,0:27:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,商羯罗…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sankara! Sankara…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.15,0:27:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,商羯罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sankara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.46,0:28:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小孩从那魔宫逃出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little boy escaped from the evil palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.01,0:28:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有无数小孩被困{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many other children still there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we do, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.98,0:28:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.90,0:28:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人相信这条村的幸运石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that somebody believes the good luck rock from this village{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是已失散的商羯罗石之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is one of the lost Sankara Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.82,0:28:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,商羯罗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Sankara?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.99,0:28:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,即是财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune and glory, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.50,0:28:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.36,0:29:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉 别再闹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie, quit monkeying around on that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.37,0:29:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,且慢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait a second! Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.58,0:29:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能就这样去德里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go to Delhi like this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.91,0:29:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是去德里 而是去彭高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to Delhi, doll. We're going to Pankot Palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.38,0:29:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭高？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pankot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.63,0:29:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能去彭高 我是个歌手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go to Pankot! I'm a singer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.13,0:29:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要联络经理人 有电话打吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I need to call my agent. Is there a phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.84,0:29:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody, I need a phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.35,0:30:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再抱怨了 这可是奢侈品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, quit complaining. This is expensive stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.11,0:30:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我去美国 我们加入马戏团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come to America with me, and we get job in circus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.65,0:30:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？你喜欢美国吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that? You like America?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.86,0:30:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大的鸟儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What big birds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.95,0:30:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 那不是鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those aren't big birds, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.41,0:30:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大型吸血蝙蝠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're giant vampire bats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.83,0:30:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.76,0:31:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍安无躁 这不痛的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pipe down, you big baboon. This doesn't hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.76,0:31:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可知道你需要什么？就是洗个澡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you really need? You really need a bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.61,0:31:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha, very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.70,0:31:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.74,0:31:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑身湿透{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All wet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.08,0:31:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来在上海过得很开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was happy in Shanghai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.83,0:31:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一间小屋和一个花园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a little house and a garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.34,0:31:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友非富则贵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends were rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.46,0:31:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经常去派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went to parties all the time in limousines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.92,0:31:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌在野外！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate being outside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.97,0:31:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个歌手 这会弄坏嗓子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a singer! I could lose my voice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.73,0:31:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们在这里露营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we'll camp here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.90,0:31:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.40,0:32:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎样？ - 两张六点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you got? - Two sixes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.49,0:32:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,三张A 我赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aha-ha, three aces. I win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.24,0:32:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快要输光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more game, I have all your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩扑克牌 输赢可说不准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's poker, Shorty, anything can happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.29,0:32:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪找来的这保镖？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find your little bodyguard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.88,0:32:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't find him, I caught him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.34,0:32:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.63,0:32:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的家人被日军杀害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty's family were killed when the Japanese bombed Shanghai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.84,0:32:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从四岁就开始四处流浪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been living on the streets since he was four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.93,0:32:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,扒我钱包时被我逮着 是不是 豆钉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I caught him trying to pick my pocket, didn't I, short stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.06,0:32:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最麻烦的就是那声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biggest trouble with her is the noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.24,0:32:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出千 你出老千{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! You cheat, Dr. Jones. You cheat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.41,0:32:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？ - 你拿了四张牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - You take four card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.49,0:32:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快付钱 - 它们粘在一起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You pay now. - Oh, they were stuck together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.91,0:32:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有粘在一起 - 它们就是粘在一起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No stuck. No mistake. - They were stuck together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.29,0:32:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一时错手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.41,0:32:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出千欺负小孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very little. You cheat very big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.75,0:32:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你出千{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, you cheat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.63,0:32:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我一毛钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pay money. You owe me ten cent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.30,0:33:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个 看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.93,0:33:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还敢说我出千？是你出千{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You accuse me of cheating. You're cheating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.85,0:33:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我输钱 没意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me poor. No fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.27,0:33:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你玩真没意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play with you no fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.94,0:33:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不玩了 - 我也不玩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I quit. - I quit, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.03,0:33:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方完全被包围了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is completely surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.03,0:33:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是野生动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire place is crawling with living things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.36,0:33:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是森林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they call it the jungle, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.78,0:33:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会有什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, what else is out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.37,0:33:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie, wait…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.13,0:33:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie, Willie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.96,0:33:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个简称吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? Is that short for something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.13,0:33:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的艺名 印第安纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Willie" is my professional name, Indiana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.93,0:33:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你要叫他琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lady, you call him Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.80,0:33:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的艺名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My professional name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.60,0:33:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要去这魔宫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you dragging us off to this deserted palace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.14,0:33:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,财富和光荣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune and glory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.85,0:33:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.31,0:33:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.03,0:34:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这源自古代的手稿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a piece of an old manuscript.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.32,0:34:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这幅壁画里的是祭司商羯罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This pictograph represents Sankara, a priest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.16,0:34:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.41,0:34:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 这个有几百年的历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentle. Gentle. This is hundreds of years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.29,0:34:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是文字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that some kind of writing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.75,0:34:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是梵文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's Sanskrit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.41,0:34:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.50,0:34:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,源自商羯罗传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's part of the legend of Sankara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.34,0:34:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他攀登凯拉萨山拜见印度神湿婆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He climbs Mount Kalisa where he meets Siva, the Hindu god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.96,0:34:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是湿婆？他给祭司的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Siva? And what's he handing the priest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.63,0:34:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣石 - 停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rocks. - Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.39,0:34:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吩咐他去对抗邪魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told him to go forth and combat evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.97,0:34:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他五块有法力的魔石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to help him, he gave him five sacred stones with magical properties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.27,0:34:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔石？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic rocks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.85,0:34:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爷爷是魔术师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandpa was a magician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.36,0:34:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他终生都在做帽子藏兔子 袖子藏鸽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spent his entire life with a rabbit in his pocket and pigeons up his sleeves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.82,0:34:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让不少小孩开怀大笑 自己却潦倒终老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made a lot of children happy and died a very poor man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.24,0:34:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔石 财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic rocks. Fortune and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.37,0:34:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个好梦吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.03,0:34:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上哪儿去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.99,0:34:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该靠近我睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd sleep closer, if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.21,0:34:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了安全起见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For safety's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.25,0:35:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我与蛇共枕更安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, I'd be safer sleeping with a snake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.51,0:35:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你别再瞎闹了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, cut it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.18,0:35:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这大象真讨厌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that elephant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.46,0:35:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.46,0:35:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见了 那就是彭高皇宫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it, Shorty. That's it. Pankot Palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.46,0:37:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你在看什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, what you look at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.63,0:37:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.01,0:37:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不要走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no, no, no! Don't leave! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.68,0:37:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.68,0:37:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖大象 呆在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby elephant, stay here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.52,0:37:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.69,0:37:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带走了大象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're stealing our rides!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.36,0:37:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从这里开始步行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We walk from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.81,0:38:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.36,0:38:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们迷路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should say you look rather lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.90,0:38:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在这世上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I cannot imagine where in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.11,0:38:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们视何处为家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the three of you would look at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.24,0:38:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没迷路 我们在去德里的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not lost. We're on our way to Delhi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.08,0:38:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是丝葛小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Miss Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是豆钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mr. Round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.95,0:38:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小豆钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short Round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.25,0:38:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫印第安纳·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Indiana Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.75,0:38:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 著名的考古学家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, the eminent archeologist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.71,0:38:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以相信吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to believe, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.42,0:38:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在牛津初闻你的大名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember first hearing your name when I was up at Oxford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.68,0:38:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是查达·拉尔 彭高王公的首相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Chattar Lal, Prime Minister to His Highness, the Maharajah of Pankot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.18,0:38:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm enchanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.77,0:38:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 非常感谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enchanted. Thank you very much. Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.60,0:38:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到彭高皇宫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Pankot Palace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.11,0:38:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enchanted, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.21,0:39:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉 我的剃刀呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty, where's my razor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.23,0:39:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴今晚来了多位稀客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are fortunate tonight to have so many unexpected visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.95,0:39:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是上尉…庞拔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Captain… …Blumburtt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.78,0:39:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,浦那步枪队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}11th Poona Rifles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.32,0:39:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该是琼斯博士了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, sir, are Dr. Jones, I presume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.66,0:39:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.87,0:39:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉的部队来作例行检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Blumburtt and his troops are on a routine inspection tour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.00,0:39:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,英军喜欢随时来监察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British find it amusing to inspect us at their convenience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.63,0:39:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒希望没给你带来不便 首相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do hope, sir, that it's not inconvenient to you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.01,0:40:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国很关心其帝国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British worry so about their empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.84,0:40:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们觉得是受宠爱的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes us all feel like well-cared-for children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.19,0:40:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明艳照人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.15,0:40:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,王公财雄势大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the Maharajah is swimming in loot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.49,0:40:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许来这儿也不是那么糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it wasn't such a bad idea coming here after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.41,0:40:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活像一个皇妃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like a princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.74,0:40:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉尔先生 王公的老婆叫什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Lal, what do they call the Maharajah's wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.79,0:40:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下还没成亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Highness has not yet taken a wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.46,0:40:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他还没找到意中人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it's because he hasn't found the right woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.52,0:40:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Supreme Highness, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.60,0:40:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭高传统的守护者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}guardian of Pankot tradition, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.69,0:40:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭高王公{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Maharajah of Pankot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.99,0:41:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙林·辛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zalim Singh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.89,0:41:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是王公？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Maharajah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.22,0:41:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小孩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.06,0:41:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他喜欢老女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he like older women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.20,0:41:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞拔上尉告诉了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Blumburtt was just telling me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.91,0:41:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇宫的历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}something of the interesting history of the palace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.45,0:41:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有它在叛乱时期的重要性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the importance it played in the mutiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.16,0:41:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来英国无法忘记1857年的叛乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems the British never forget the Mutiny of 1857.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.79,0:41:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为叛乱前的一些事件…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, you know, I think there are other events, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.96,0:41:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,再往前一百多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the mutiny, going back a century, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.25,0:42:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱夫时代更有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to the time of Clive, that are more interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.30,0:42:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪些事件？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what events are those, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.63,0:42:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我没记错 这个地区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if memory serves me correctly, this area, this province, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.97,0:42:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾盛行邪教{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the center of activity for the Thuggee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.23,0:42:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大蛇宝盆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake… Surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.44,0:42:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么宝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the surprise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.57,0:42:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 你真是见多识广{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, you know perfectly well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.66,0:42:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪教的歪风已灭绝近百年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Thuggee cult has been dead for nearly a century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.25,0:42:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.16,0:42:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些坏蛋祭拜卡莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thuggee was an obscenity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.67,0:42:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,以人祭神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that worshipped Kali with human sacrifices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.42,0:42:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,英军已把他们铲除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British Army nicely did away with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.84,0:42:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看邪教的故事难以失传{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I suppose stories of the Thuggee die hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.26,0:42:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这种事发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no stories anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.27,0:42:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个说不准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从小村落来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came from a small village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.69,0:43:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,农民说彭高因有邪魔之力而大盛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The peasants there told us Pankot Palace was growing powerful again because of some ancient evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.03,0:43:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是骇人听闻的民间传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Village stories, Dr. Jones. They're just fear and folklore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.49,0:43:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令庞拔上尉担心起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beginning to worry Captain Blumburtt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.74,0:43:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没这回事 我只是觉得有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not worried, Mr. Prime Minister, just interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.14,0:43:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不吃东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You are not eating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.94,0:43:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,午餐吃过甲虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had bugs for lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.90,0:43:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我帽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.57,0:43:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.99,0:43:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想吐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm gonna puke in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.29,0:43:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,村民说彭高的人拿走了一些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the villagers also told us Pankot Palace had taken something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.75,0:44:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在本国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, in our country, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.54,0:44:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少有宾客侮辱主人家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not usual for a guest to insult his host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.84,0:44:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.09,0:44:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为我们在谈民间传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were talking about folklore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.55,0:44:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问有没有简单点的？例如汤？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir, do you have anything simple, like soup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.85,0:44:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到底有什么东西被拿走了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly was it they say was stolen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.19,0:44:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sacred rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.69,0:44:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见了 上尉 一块石头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Captain, a rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.29,0:44:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那块圣石跟商羯罗传说有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something connected the villagers' rock and the old legend of the Sankara Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.38,0:44:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都明白人言可畏的道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, we are all vulnerable to vicious rumors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.05,0:44:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得洪都拉斯曾指你是盗墓者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to remember that in Honduras you were accused of being a grave robber{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.52,0:45:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是考古学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than an archeologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.31,0:45:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,报章把事情夸张渲染了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the newspapers greatly exaggerated the incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.73,0:45:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,马达加斯加国王不是说你若再踏入他们的国土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wasn't it the Sultan of Madagascar who threatened to cut your head off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要斩你的头吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you ever returned to his country?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.48,0:45:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是斩头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wasn't my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.61,0:45:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是斩手吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then your hands, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.99,0:45:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是斩手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wasn't my hands, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.07,0:45:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.53,0:45:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一场误会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My misunderstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.91,0:45:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正是如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what we have here, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.29,0:45:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对邪教的恶行有所闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard the evil stories of the Thuggee cult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.42,0:45:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为那只是吓唬小孩之说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the stories were told to frighten children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.13,0:45:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我发现曾经真有其事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, I learnt the Thuggee cult was once real{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.34,0:45:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们作恶多端{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and did of unspeakable things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.18,0:45:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以这一段历史为耻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am ashamed of what happened here so many years ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.85,0:45:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.26,0:45:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,本国不会再有此歪风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this will never happen again in my kingdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.19,0:45:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我出言冒犯了陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I offended you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.36,0:45:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.83,0:46:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dessert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.38,0:46:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻猴子脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chilled monkey brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.15,0:46:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先去看看威莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll just check on Willie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.70,0:46:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you better do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.78,0:46:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后告诉我情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me later what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.99,0:46:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别多事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am-scray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.59,0:46:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿了一些东西给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got something for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.76,0:46:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不会有东西是我想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing you have that I could possibly want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.68,0:47:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.07,0:47:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是一个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a very nice man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.07,0:47:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可做我的爱奴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could be my palace slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.62,0:47:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴着珠宝颈链睡觉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wear your jewels to bed, Princess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.79,0:47:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.05,0:47:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还只穿了睡袍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.13,0:47:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得意外吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shock you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.38,0:47:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会大惊小怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing shocks me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.80,0:47:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个科学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.89,0:47:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你做了不少研究？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, as a scientist, you do a lot of research?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.73,0:47:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.35,0:47:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会拿我作什么研究？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what sort of research would you do on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.28,0:47:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜间活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nocturnal activities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:47:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搽哪种面霜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like what sort of cream I put on my face at night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.86,0:48:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的睡姿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what position I like to sleep in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.74,0:48:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,交欢的习惯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mating customs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.16,0:48:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,做爱的方式？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love rituals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.49,0:48:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,原始的性趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primitive sexual practices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.29,0:48:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这一领域 你是权威吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're an authority in that area?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.33,0:48:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年研习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years of fieldwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.38,0:48:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怪你气我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you for being sore at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.18,0:48:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺难缠的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be hard to handle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.52,0:48:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇过更糟的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.93,0:48:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是最好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll never have better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.11,0:48:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.90,0:48:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,做实验不能先入为主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a scientist, I don't want to prejudice my experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.24,0:48:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you know in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.99,0:48:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个自大鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you conceited ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.66,0:48:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没那么随便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not that easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.58,0:48:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是那么随便的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not that easy, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.21,0:48:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的麻烦是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble with you is, Willie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.83,0:48:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太习惯人家顺从你的做法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're too used to getting your own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.88,0:48:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太自负{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're just too proud to admit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.21,0:48:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不肯承认为我着迷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're crazy about me, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.88,0:49:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你要找我 你知道我在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want me, Willie, you know where you can find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.51,0:49:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.05,0:49:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会在五分钟内回头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be back over here in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.14,0:49:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我已睡着了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be asleep in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.77,0:49:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.06,0:49:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这自有分晓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it, and I know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.08,0:49:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.25,0:49:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,四分半钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four and a half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.05,0:50:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「爱奴」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Palace slave."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.68,0:50:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,「夜间活动」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Nocturnal activities."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.60,0:50:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个「自大鬼」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a "conceited ape"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.23,0:50:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,「明早再说」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll tell you in the morning."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.52,0:50:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.57,0:50:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.28,0:50:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.24,0:50:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以相信我不过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I'm not going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.97,0:51:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indiana Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.60,0:51:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一晚你会毕生难忘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one night you'll never forget!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.35,0:51:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这一晚你错失了大好良机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the night I slipped right through your fingers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.56,0:51:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你睡得安好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep tight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.90,0:51:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个美梦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pleasant dreams!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.53,0:51:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来可以是你最大的寻宝收获{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have been your greatest adventure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.75,0:51:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你的皮鞭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, your whip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.56,0:52:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉风扇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn off the switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.20,0:52:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.70,0:52:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我温柔一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be gentle with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.37,0:52:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.05,0:52:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.43,0:52:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.43,0:52:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 你古古怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, you're acting awfully strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.13,0:53:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在你的面前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.19,0:53:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「跟随湿婆的足迹」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Follow in the footsteps of Siva."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.65,0:53:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.57,0:53:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「别背叛他的真理」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Do not betray these truths."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.91,0:53:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉 去拿工具来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty, go get our stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.52,0:54:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉 留在我背后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay behind me, Short Round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.65,0:54:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我走 别碰任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step where I step, and don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.79,0:54:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟随你的脚步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I step where you step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.33,0:54:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不碰任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I touch nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.55,0:54:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.19,0:54:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我踩住了一些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I step on something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.16,0:54:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也感觉到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there's something on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.49,0:55:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,地上好像铺满了签饼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel like step on fortune cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.04,0:55:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是签饼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fortune cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.29,0:55:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.81,0:55:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是签饼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.14,0:55:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我弄走它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.27,0:55:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跟我来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. There, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.19,0:56:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,停步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.36,0:56:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你靠着墙站 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just stand up against the wall, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.58,0:56:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你叫我靠着墙站的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say to stand against the wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.83,0:56:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照你说的做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I listen to what you say!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.25,0:56:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是我的错 - 威莉 快下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not my fault! Not my fault! - Willie, get down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.42,0:56:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in trouble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.55,0:56:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie! Willie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.34,0:56:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要弄得一身脏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet I get all dirty again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.39,0:56:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 威莉 快下来 - 不是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Willie, get down here! - Not my fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.01,0:56:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in trouble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.60,0:56:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦？什么麻烦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble? Trouble? What sort of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.91,0:57:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是闹着玩的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is serious!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.70,0:57:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有两条尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two dead people down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.25,0:57:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿也快要有两条尸体了 快来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're going to be two dead people in here! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.54,0:57:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够你们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've almost had enough of you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.88,0:57:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.05,0:57:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,急什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the rush?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.92,0:57:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们就快没命了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long story, Willie. Hurry, or you don't get to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.10,0:57:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, what is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.73,0:57:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, what is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.44,0:57:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿漆黑一片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see a thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.56,0:57:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.73,0:57:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.73,0:57:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,指甲弄断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke a nail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.46,0:57:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉 赶快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.08,0:57:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在我头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in my hair!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.17,0:57:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 威莉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Willie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.21,0:58:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我进来 - 不 让我们出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Indy, let me in! - No, let us out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.80,0:58:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我进来 - 让我们出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me in! - Let us out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.93,0:58:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴！- 我下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up! - I'm down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.72,0:58:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我满身都是虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all over me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.85,0:58:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有机关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a fulcrum release lever somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.60,0:58:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.77,0:58:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门的机关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handle that opens the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.81,0:58:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快找 - 不 只有方洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go on! - They're just, just square holes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.61,0:58:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,去右边的洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the right hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.44,0:58:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快！威莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Willie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.78,0:58:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个 你右边那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other one! The other right. Your other right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.87,0:58:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你右边那个 - 里面湿漉漉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The one on your right! - There's slime inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.87,0:58:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.58,0:58:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做得到 伸手进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it. Feel inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.67,0:58:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.30,0:58:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伸手摸摸看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.13,0:58:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.51,0:58:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.06,0:59:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉 我们快要死了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie, we are going to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.98,0:59:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,软软的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's soft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.32,0:59:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.75,0:59:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.51,0:59:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮我拍走身上的虫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em off of me! Get 'em off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.64,0:59:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮我拍走身上的虫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all over me! Get 'em off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.02,0:59:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.44,0:59:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我 是她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me! It's her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.28,0:59:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.53,0:59:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来！快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Move! Come on, move! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.59,1:00:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是邪教仪式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Thuggee ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.76,1:00:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在祭拜卡莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're worshipping Kali.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.81,1:01:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen anything like this before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.57,1:01:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,百年来没人见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's seen this for a hundred years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.87,1:02:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莉神 卡莉神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kali Ma. Kali Ma…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.50,1:02:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莉神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kali Ma!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.88,1:03:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.15,1:06:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是村民的圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the rock they took from the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.40,1:06:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,商羯罗石之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of the Sankara Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.16,1:06:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们怎么会发亮？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why they glow like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.12,1:06:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legend says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.79,1:06:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当圣石汇聚在一起时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the rocks are brought together, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.13,1:06:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的钻石会发光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the diamonds inside them will glow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.17,1:06:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diamonds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.30,1:06:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.47,1:06:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diamonds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.76,1:06:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.28,1:06:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们安静地留在这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I want you two to stay up here and keep quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.12,1:06:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉 你盯着她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty, you keep an eye on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.53,1:06:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪里？ - 下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why, where are you going? - Down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.33,1:06:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面？你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down there? Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.46,1:06:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿回圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving here without the stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.67,1:07:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会为追求财富和光荣而死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could get killed chasing after your damn fortune and glory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.96,1:07:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.55,1:07:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.67,1:08:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.28,1:09:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.53,1:09:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.62,1:09:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉 快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Willie! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.89,1:11:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.76,1:11:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,早告诉你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep telling you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.22,1:11:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的话 你就会更长命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you listen me more, you live longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.39,1:11:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你让我死掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let me die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.52,1:11:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈求湿婆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray to Siva, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.36,1:11:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「让我死掉」 但死不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let me die, " but I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.07,1:11:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在卡莉的邪力占据了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… Now the evil of Kali take me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.62,1:11:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.87,1:11:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会被迫喝卡莉的血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will make me drink the blood of the Kali.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.75,1:11:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着我就会受邪魔操控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll fall into the Black Sleep of the Kali Ma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.37,1:11:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.63,1:11:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他们那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We become like them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.51,1:11:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们虽生犹死 是活死人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be alive, but like a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.38,1:12:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝了魔血就会如行尸走肉一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drink blood, you not wake up from nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.73,1:12:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷商羯罗石时被逮个正着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were caught trying to steal the Sankara Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.45,1:12:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来有五颗圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were five stones in the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.62,1:12:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百年来 圣石因战乱散失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the centuries, they were dispersed by wars, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.62,1:12:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或被你这种盗贼偷走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sold off by thieves like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.83,1:12:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这种盗贼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thieves like me, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.12,1:12:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还欠两块圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still missing two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.21,1:12:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百年前 英军血洗这间庙宇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A century ago, when the British raided this temple and butchered my people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.51,1:12:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,祭司把那两块圣石藏在地下墓穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a loyal priest hid the last two stones down here in the catacombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.97,1:12:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要那批奴隶替你掘墓？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what you've got these slaves digging for, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.72,1:12:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是无辜的小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're innocent children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.14,1:12:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们采宝石来资助我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They dig for the gems to support our cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.35,1:12:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也在寻找那两块圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They also search for the last two stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.48,1:13:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久我们就会集齐五块圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon we will have all the five Sankara Stones, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.15,1:13:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这帮人就能大权在握{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Thuggees will be all powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.57,1:13:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的想像力真丰富{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a vivid imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.33,1:13:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.80,1:13:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会相信的 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.34,1:13:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成为其中一个虔诚的信徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will become a true believer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.20,1:13:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.06,1:14:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.39,1:14:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别喝魔血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drink, it's bad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.93,1:14:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别喝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drink!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.02,1:14:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把它吐出来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spit it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.35,1:14:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.95,1:15:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别胡来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dare not do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.93,1:15:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打他 混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him alone, you bastards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.53,1:15:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,英军会被歼灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British in India will be slaughtered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.82,1:15:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们控制穆斯林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we will overrun the Muslims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.15,1:15:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后犹太人的神会没落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the Hebrew God will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.70,1:15:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,基督教的神也会随之被摒弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the Christian God will be cast down and forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.16,1:15:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久卡莉神就会统治世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, Kali Ma will rule the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.71,1:16:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.07,1:17:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莉神保佑我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kali Ma protects us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.03,1:17:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是她的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are her children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.41,1:17:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以人祭神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pledge our devotion to her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.62,1:18:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,以显虔诚之心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an offering of flesh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.62,1:18:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.29,1:18:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还奉上鲜血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.47,1:18:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友对这一切已耳闻目睹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend has seen, and she has heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.94,1:18:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她要保守秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she will not talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.16,1:18:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这个地方毫无好印象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to have anything nice to say about this place when I get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.20,1:18:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第！快救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy! For God sakes, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.66,1:18:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.01,1:19:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.71,1:19:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.87,1:20:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indiana…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.25,1:20:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳 救我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indiana, help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.39,1:20:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你快醒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, snap out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.93,1:20:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是他们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.73,1:20:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你醒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.61,1:20:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别舍我而去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.63,1:20:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.92,1:21:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.22,1:21:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you mad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.59,1:22:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会是真的 这不会是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening, this can't be happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.84,1:22:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉 醒醒吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Willie, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.04,1:22:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.93,1:23:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.56,1:23:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 快醒来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Dr. Jones, wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.11,1:23:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.46,1:23:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.38,1:23:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快醒来 印第！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Indy! Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.13,1:23:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我最好的朋友 快醒来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my best friend! Wake up, Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.52,1:23:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.31,1:23:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.40,1:24:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事了 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.20,1:24:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫拉林！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mola Ram!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.45,1:26:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some slack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.43,1:26:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉 快醒来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie, Willie, wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.18,1:26:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉 是我 我醒过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie, Willie, it's me! I'm back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.44,1:26:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.13,1:27:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.38,1:27:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.06,1:27:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, now, let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.77,1:27:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 所有人离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.73,1:28:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.83,1:29:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to save him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.04,1:29:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会照顾自己 - 他需要我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He can take care of himself. - He needs me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.00,1:29:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去救印第！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to save Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.55,1:29:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 去救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.64,1:29:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.15,1:29:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我宰了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kill you! Drop him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.64,1:30:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么搞的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.47,1:30:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个打他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Try this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.38,1:32:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,打 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.49,1:33:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卡莉邪术令你失去理智{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the Black Sleep of Kali.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.05,1:33:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short Round!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.42,1:33:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟那小子瞎闹 快下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit fooling around with that kid! Get down in the cart, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.93,1:33:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okeydokey, Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.68,1:33:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 沿左边隧道逃生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please listen. To get out, you must take the left tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.89,1:33:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.07,1:34:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉 快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty! Quit stalling!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.69,1:34:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.03,1:34:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.45,1:34:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.08,1:34:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉 小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty, look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.50,1:34:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.01,1:34:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.31,1:35:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快！赶快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.86,1:35:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 沿左边隧道走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, take the left tunnel! The left tunnel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.32,1:35:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你搞错了 左边隧道！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Indy! You missed it! Left tunnel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.02,1:35:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们追来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got company!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.07,1:35:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停 - 不要停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - Let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.90,1:35:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开刹车掣 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let go of the brake. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.07,1:35:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 不要停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.65,1:35:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开刹车掣 这才有机会逃脱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only chance is to outrun them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.13,1:36:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.34,1:36:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来控制刹车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come up here and take the brake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.39,1:36:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心弯位 否则会脱轨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it on the curves, or we'll fly right off the track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.14,1:36:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.80,1:37:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么？ - 走捷径{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Short cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.97,1:37:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 印第 - 豆钉 切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Indy. - Short, cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.83,1:38:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.46,1:38:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.09,1:38:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓牢！- 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on! - Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.22,1:38:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉他过来 - 放开我！放开我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull him in. - Let me go! Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.06,1:38:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.77,1:38:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.23,1:38:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉他过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull him in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.35,1:38:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去抓他 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll catch him! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.11,1:39:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.05,1:39:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.22,1:39:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,刹车 刹车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brakes. Brakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.88,1:39:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快减速 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Slow us down. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.10,1:39:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下大错特错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big mistake. Big mistake, Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.69,1:39:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如所料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.04,1:40:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,车速太快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going too fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.63,1:40:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.09,1:40:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会撞车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to crash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.98,1:40:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,水！水！水！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water, water, water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.69,1:40:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看那边 - 水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look! Look there! - Water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.31,1:40:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的鞋子冒烟了 - 水！水！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire! You're on fire! - Water, water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.65,1:40:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看… - 水 水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look… - Water, water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.74,1:40:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,洪水！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water, water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.24,1:40:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.96,1:41:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.63,1:41:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.02,1:41:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉 小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willie, look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.53,1:41:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.74,1:41:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快去吊桥那边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head for the bridge. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.79,1:41:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,威莉 快来 走这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Willie, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.60,1:41:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.01,1:42:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！吊桥很稳固{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go. Strong bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.23,1:42:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,木板很坚固{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, strong wood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.90,1:42:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.32,1:42:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.86,1:42:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.03,1:42:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！我要掉下去了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! I'm falling down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.70,1:42:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.12,1:42:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才不有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.61,1:42:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.63,1:43:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.98,1:43:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,放她走 莫拉林！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go, Mola Ram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.19,1:43:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这关头你才没资格发号施令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in a position unsuitable to give orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.65,1:43:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你背后！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.21,1:43:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要圣石？那快放人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the stones, let 'em go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.42,1:43:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.34,1:43:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽管把圣石扔掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop them, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.01,1:43:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣石可以寻回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.47,1:44:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却不可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.35,1:44:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.52,1:44:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心背后！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.74,1:44:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.46,1:44:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.21,1:44:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.85,1:44:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on! Go on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.64,1:44:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.27,1:44:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.78,1:45:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳 小姐 我们要玩命了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, lady. We going for a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.16,1:45:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.83,1:45:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！我的天！我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, my God! Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.75,1:45:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是神经病吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he nuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.25,1:45:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He no nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.79,1:45:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直发疯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.71,1:45:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫拉林 去地狱见你的卡莉吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mola Ram, prepare to meet Kali in hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.39,1:45:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.06,1:45:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.66,1:46:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 护住胸口！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, cover your heart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.45,1:46:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,护住胸口！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover your heart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.04,1:46:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.68,1:46:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.05,1:47:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心！- 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look out! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.91,1:47:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.88,1:48:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快爬上去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.50,1:48:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣石是我的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stones are mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.59,1:48:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了湿婆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've betrayed Siva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.81,1:48:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了湿婆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed Siva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.78,1:48:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了湿婆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed Siva!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.31,1:48:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's about time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.50,1:49:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.58,1:51:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当村里恢复生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you are coming back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.12,1:51:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就知道你们会平安归来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when life return to our village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.96,1:51:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你该明白圣石的威力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can see the magic of the rock you bring back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.76,1:51:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I understand its power now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.31,1:51:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来可以保留圣石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've kept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.90,1:51:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么？还不是放在博物馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for? They'd just put it in a museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.90,1:51:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着铺满尘埃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be another rock collecting dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.40,1:51:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它本可以为你带来财富和光荣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then it would've given you your fortune and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.03,1:51:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事难料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything could happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.86,1:52:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去德里路途遥远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long way to Delhi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.16,1:52:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.33,1:52:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再跟你冒险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more adventures with you, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.66,1:52:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这旅程不是充满乐趣吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, after all the fun we've had together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.38,1:52:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你以为你让我吃了这么多苦头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think I'm going to Delhi with you, or anyplace else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.50,1:52:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会跟你上路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all the trouble you've gotten me into, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.59,1:52:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真会做梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}think again, buster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.38,1:52:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就回家去 不用吃蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going home to Missouri where they never feed you snakes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.88,1:52:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不用被挖心肝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before ripping your heart out and lowering you into hot pits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.68,1:52:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我而言 绝不是乐趣！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not my idea of a swell time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.27,1:52:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我要找向导带我去德里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir. I need a guide to Delhi. If you could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.04,1:52:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.00,1:52:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.{\r}
